ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Verás, sé que había una cosica que
estabas deseando comprarte.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Y como también sé que piensas
que soy un gruñón,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} he decidido
demostrarte que soy buena persona.
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡A ver si así te callas ya de una vez!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Toma.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Para ti,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Tu sais ce truc sur lequel tu louches
dans toutes les vitrines ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je viens
de te l'acheter !
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tiens,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} il est tout à toi !{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Ich hab gestern auf meinem
Spaziergang was gefunden.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
Hier.
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Das Ding riecht so brutal nach
Herrenparfüm, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}das kann eigentlich
nur dir gehören.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Yeah, when you came over to my
house the other day,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}you sprayed
some funky stuff, didn't you?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I still can't get rid of that smell!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}You!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Do something about it already!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Quand tu es venu chez moi l'autre
jour,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} tu as utilisé un spray bizarre,
non ?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Je n'arrive pas à me débarrasser de
l'odeur !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Toi !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Fais quelque chose,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Quando sei venuto a casa mia
l'altro giorno,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}hai spruzzato in giro
una roba strana, non è vero?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Non riesco a far sparire quell'odore!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Tu!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Fai qualcosa! Subito!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Geçen gün evime geldiğinde,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}tuhaf
bir şey püskürtmüştün, değil mi?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}O kokuyu hâlâ çıkaramıyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Sen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Artık bir şey yap şuna!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0012:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Unuttuğunu söyleme sakın!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bugün
geleceğini söylemiştin, hatırlasana?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ne zaman geleceğini bilmediğim
için,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}} kişisinden seni gidip
almasını istedim.
{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Benimle ne konuşmak istiyordun acaba?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}
